# The Alternate Worlds of World Literature.

**Authors:** Lawall, Sarah

## Abstract
Discusses some problems associated with defining &quot;world&quot; literature. Examines information collected from applicants to a National Endowment for the Humanities Institute in the Theory and Teaching of World Literature, concerning teaching situations and opinions on world literature courses. (MM)

